LMN 1
title: Two Lanterns
artist: Shiori examples
tempo: 76
time: 3/4
key: C major, lifting to D major
mood: warm, full, tearful; the true ending

// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Mio's theme as the true ending. It begins a step below home and climbs
// back to the theme's own key, D major, for the last statement: the ones who
// are nearly home.
//
//   Prelude  4  piano alone, the minor form of the hook (as in "Unlit") but
//               warmed by F and Dm7 instead of the lament chords
//   Verse   16  C major. Bars 1-8: the cello (Rin) sings Mio's tune over a
//               rippling piano. Bars 9-16: the flute (Mio) takes it over with
//               the harp, the cello turns into her counter-line
//   Bridge   8  violins and horns in octaves on the theme's B-strain, choir
//               enters, the line rises to Bb (bVI of D), timpani roll and a
//               harp sweep on A7: the key lift
//   Final   18  D major, tutti. Flute and violins in unison, piano an octave
//               above from the climax on, horns on the counter-line. The high
//               D6 that never came in "Unlit" arrives and is held for two bars
//               while the bass climbs G G# A (the lament inverted), then a
//               deceptive cadence (A -> Bm7) delays home once more
//   Coda     5  the hook on piano, the flute holds D6, and the choir sings
//               the "amen": Gm6 -> D, Bb finally resolving to A
//
// FORM  51 bars of 3/4, tempo 68 -> 72 -> 74 -> 76 -> 62 with broadening at
//       the climax and the end, about 2:14. It ends; looped, the A minor
//       prelude follows the final D naturally.
//
// HARMONY
//   Prelude: Am(add9) | Fmaj7 | Dm7 | Fmaj7/G
//   Verse:   C | Am7 | Fmaj7 | G7sus4 G | Em7 | Am7 | Dm7 | G7sus4 G7 |
//            C | Am7 Am7/G | Fmaj7 | Em7 | Dm7 | C/G | G7 | C |
//   Bridge:  Fmaj7 | C/E | Dm7 | Bbmaj7 | F/A | Gm7 | Bbmaj7 | A7sus4 A7
//   Final:   D | Bm7 | Gmaj7 | A7sus4 A | F#m7 | Bm7 | Em7 | A7sus4 A7 |
//            D | Bm7 Bm7/A | Gmaj7 | G#m7b5 | A | Bm7 | Em7 | A7sus4 A7 | D | D
//   Coda:    D | Bm7 | Gmaj7 | Gm6 | D
// ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

track flute    flute         vol=80 pan=-10 reverb=40
track piano    piano         vol=62 pan=-18 reverb=40
track harp     harp          vol=58 pan=-30 reverb=45
track strings  strings       vol=60 pan=10  reverb=45
track cello    cello         vol=64 pan=20  reverb=40
track horns    french_horn   vol=56 pan=28  reverb=50
track choir    choir_pad     vol=38 pan=0   reverb=55
track timp     timpani       vol=50 pan=-6  reverb=55

